  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 220 C. Wash the potatoes and cut them into 2 cm cubes, skin on.",
   "Mix the potatoes with half of the paprika, garlic powder, oregano and black pepper, plus a pinch of salt. Spread them on a tray lined with baking paper. No oil. Bake 20 minutes.",
   "Season the chicken breasts with the rest of the spices and salt. Add them to the tray, turn the potatoes, and bake 20 to 25 minutes more, until the chicken is white inside and the potatoes are golden.",
   "Mix the skyr with a pinch of garlic powder, black pepper and salt for a quick dressing.",
   "Slice the chicken. Serve with the potatoes and the skyr dressing. To reheat at work, store the chicken and potatoes in a box and the dressing apart; microwave 2 minutes and add the dressing after."
  ]
